ro's Insignia Ring","item":"Coldain Hero's Insignia Ring","wikiPath":"/Coldain_Hero%27s_Insignia_Ring"},{"text":"Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV","item":"Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV","wikiPath":"/Ring_of_Dain_Frostreaver_IV"}],"card":{"title":"Coldain Ring Quests","lines":["Minimum Level: 30+ (to start)","Classes: All","Related Zones: Various","Related NPCs: Various"]},"links":["Eastern Wastes","Garadain Glacierbane","Copper Coldain Insignia Ring","Silver Coldain Insignia Ring","Gold Coldain Insignia Ring","Platinum Coldain Insignia Ring","Obsidian Coldain Insignia Ring","Mithril Coldain Insignia Ring","Adamantium Coldain Insignia Ring","Velium Coldain Insignia Ring","Shield of the Eighth","Coldain Hero's Insignia Ring","Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV","Frostreaver's Blessing","Tailoring","Blacksmithing","Brewing","Coldain Hunting Blanket","Dull Bladed Axe","Boridain Glacierbane","Rabid Tundra Kodiak","Rabid Kodiak Skin","Broken Axe","Coldain Hunting Knife","High Quality Walrus Hide","Skinning Rock","Wooly Rhino Horn","Tain Hammerfrost","Frozen Elixir","Coldain Smithing Hammer","Ry'Gorr Messenger","Ry'Gorr Invasion Plans","A coldain lookout","Scarbrow Ga`Hruk","Head of Scarbrow","Korrigain","Icefang","Poxbreath Yellowfang","Note from Kromrif","Rodrick Tardok","Rodrick's Head","Shackle key","Warden Bruke","Corbin Blackwell","Dobbin Crossaxe","Note from Corbin","Marching Orders","Gloradin Coldheart","Chief Ry`Gorr","Chief Ry`Gorr's Head","Traitor's Bane Box","Dirk of the Traitor","Rodrick's Gift","Murdrick's head","Murdrick Tardok","Great Divide","Berradin's head","Captain Berradin","Tainted Avalanche Ale","Peffin's head","Peffin Ambersnow","Doldigun's head","Doldigun Steinwielder","Kael Drakkel","Juliah's Head","Councilor Juliash Lockhear","Ring of the Coldain Council","Box of the Guilty","Dain Frostreaver IV","Dirk of the Dain","Frost Strike","Declaration of War","Orders of engagement","Zrelik the Scout","Narandi's head","High Quality Cougarskin","High Quality Tundra Kodiak Pelt","A snow cougar","A tundra kodiak","Sewing Kit","Coldain","Dain Frostreaver IV (Faction)","Kromzek","Kromrif","A Wooly Rhino","A walrus","Forge","Note to Tain","Ghrek Squatnot","A Ry`Gorr invader","A Ry`Gorr oracle","Frozen Orb","Iceclad Ocean","Oracle of Ry`Gorr","Rygorr Clan Snow Orcs","Citizens of Froststone","Ry`Gorr Emissary","Shackle Key","Calm","Commander Bahreck","Entrapping Roots","Claws of Veeshan","Lapker Geynion","Laima Ratgur","Davin Fatfist","Gerton Dumkin","Herga Ratgur","Fomgrut Borkel","Murdrick's Plan","Bottle","Iceball","Ice Wyvern Stinger","Arctic Mussels","Seahorse Scales","Runed Sea Shell","Mind Melt","Bodyguard Nergan","Bodyguard Persevil","Bodyguard Stoneberg","Letter to Peffin","Letter to Doldigun","Talisen, Bow of the Trailblazer","Valorankt Zekkin","Sentry Badain","Narandi the Wretched","Kromrif Spearman","Kromrif Captain","Kromrif Recruit","Cleric of Zek","Kromrif General","Kromrif Warrior","Priest of Zek","Kromrif Warlord","Kromrif Veteran","High Priest of Zek","Shorn Head of Narandi","Crown of Narandi","Flowing Thought II","Eye of Narandi","Creeping Vision","Earring of the Frozen Skull","Divine Aura","Faceguard of Bentos the Hero","See Invisible","Choker of the Wretched","Flowing Thought I","Protection of the Dain"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Hrmff, what's this? A spy sent from the giant heathens, or the selfrighteous wurms perhaps? Either way, you'd be no [friend] of the great Coldain."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"A friend, you say? That remains to be seen. Much more to being a friend of the Coldain than just sayin' so. Anyway, I'm too [tired] to argue about it. I haven't slept in days."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Did I say tired? Exhausted is more like it. Ever since that blizzard last week I haven't slept a wink. I came back from huntin' snow orcs to find that my [blanket] had blown away and now I'm just too tired to rustle up a new one."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Not just any old blanket, mind ye, mine was made of the finest tundra kodiak hides and snow panther skins, two of each. When I was wrapped up in it ya couldn't see me a bit, no, I blended right into the snow, I did. Say, if you be a friend, here's yer chance to prove it. Sew me up a new blanket so I can get some rest."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Ahh, that'll do fine. Take this, it is but a trinket for now, but continue to serve the Coldain and it will grow in power. I must get some rest now, for I have been told my [nephew] has disappeared again and I will need to track him down tomorrow."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"My nephew, Boridain, keeps running away from home to kill a bothersome [beast], thinking this will prove to all of Thurgadin that he is a great hunter. Every time he does this my sister gets hysterical and I am sent out to find him."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"A rabid tundra kodiak has been feeding on our people for weeks now. If Boridain ever stumbled across the critter I doubt he'd stand a chance. I have a solution, but it would require the [assistance] of an outsider."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"I'm taking a liking to you stranger. Your eagerness to help us will not go unnoticed. Find my nephew and give him this axe. It should keep him from hurting himself. Return to me with the ring and proof that he is safe."},{"npc":"Boridain Glacierbane","text":"Hello stranger, I am Boridain, master hunter of the Coldain. Glad to meet you."},{"npc":"Boridain Glacierbane","text":"Say! This looks just like the axe my uncle uses. With this I can kill the beast for sure! Now please, be very quiet, I must track my prey. I won't return to Thurgadin without the hide of the rabid tundra kodiak!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Well done friend! My nephew is safe at home and his thirst for adventure is quenched for now. The beast will claim no more of our people. I couldn't have handled it better myself. Now I can get back to the business of [hunting]."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"My camp here boasts the most proficient hunters in the recorded history of the mighty Coldain empire. We alone could feed an entire clan. Things have been frustratingly [slow] lately, though."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"After years of skinning the hides of the giantmen, my hunting knife has lost its edge. The dull blade has slowed me down considerably. It has served me well, but a new [knife] would make me a much more proficient hunter."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Hunt a wooly rhino and take his tusk, then take a flawless hide from a walrus. Combine them in a forge with a skinning rock and bring me the new knife and the silver insignia ring."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Hrmm, not quite the work of a Coldain. Barely functional, in fact. I'll be needing to touch this up a bit. Fetch me a Coldain [smithing hammer] and I'll be sure to tell my associates in Thurgadin of your deeds."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"[Tain] Hammerfrost can get you one. Find him and give him this."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Tain left a short time ago, he said he had a score to settle with a particular Kromriff."},{"npc":"Tain Hammerfrost","text":"The bloody Kromrif ambushed me! I escaped, but I am near death. They'll be tracking me down to finish me off at any moment. Without [help], I'm as good as dead."},{"npc":"Tain Hammerfrost","text":"Thank Brell! I hear them approaching from just over that hill! Slay the leader, Ghrek, and give me his elixir."},{"npc":"Tain Hammerfrost","text":"I will report your selfless actions when I return to Thurgadin. Take this for your troubles, friend. I hope you find it useful. Fare thee well."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Ahh, there we go now, that's more like it. It would be time to return to the hunt were it not for the [plans] our spies have discovered."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"The bloody Ry'Gorr, friends of the frost giants, plan to raid our encampment. Their captain, Scarbrow Ga'hruk is leading the raid. I need someone to intercept his [orders] so we may prepare for the attack. Without them we could be in serious trouble."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Find the Ry'Gorr messenger and cut him down. Bring the message he carries to my lookout. When the attack is thwarted, return to me with the head of Scarbrow and the platinum insignia ring."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Without your assistance, we would have lost our camp and our lives. Again, I thank you. Now that you have proven your loyalty to the throne I have a special [favor] to ask of you."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"For several seasons there has been an unsolved mystery in this land. Not far from here an elite team of Coldain and their trained wolves were gathered to make a strike at the Kromrif. No one knows just what became of our strike force. Bring me proof of their fate and proof that whoever was responsible for their loss is no more."},{"npc":"Korrigain","text":"Who dares disturb my rest? If ye be a friend of the mighty Coldain, then show me proof and I shall tell you of my plight. If not, then be on your way."},{"npc":"Korrigain","text":"Many seasons ago I stood here in life with my comrades, the best warriors Thurgadin had to offer. Along with our faithful wolven army we were poised to eliminate the Kromrif presence in the region. Somehow, the enemy was made aware of our plans and just before our attack, a group of Ry'Gorr oracles charmed our wolves, forcing them to tear down their own masters. We were caught by surprise and died a savage death."},{"npc":"Korrigain","text":"All that remains from that battle is my loyal Icefang. He will not rest until I am avenged. Follow and watch after him. He alone knows where our attackers lie and he cannot overcome them by himself. May Brell bless you with success, farewell."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"A Coldain... A very important Coldain, has been abducted by the Ry'gorr. He was gathering information that is imperative to our victory over the brainless heathens. You must find him before he is killed and escort him to safety. Return to me with proof that Corbin Blackwell is safe."},{"npc":"Corbin Blackwell","text":"Hurry! There's not much time. give me the key and show me proof that you are a friend sent to rescue me..."},{"npc":"Corbin Blackwell","text":"I thought I was a dwarfskin rug there for a minute! Thank Brell for your help stranger! Now cover me while I make good my escape. I am weakened and cannot endure much more."},{"npc":"Corbin Blackwell","text":"Almost there now, just a bit further..."},{"npc":"Corbin Blackwell","text":"Uh oh, looks like they were tipped off somehow... I hope you can handle them."},{"npc":"Corbin Blackwell","text":"I'll hack at your knees 'til you fall down! Out of love for the Dain, for the glory of the crown!"},{"npc":"Corbin Blackwell","text":"I have escaped! With the help of our friends here I was saved from certain death. We are in their debt."},{"npc":"Dobbin Crossaxe","text":"We thought it was too late, the Dain will be very pleased!"},{"npc":"Dobbin Crossaxe","text":"Thank you, _____, your deeds will be mentioned to the Dain. Please take this note from Corbin to Garadain, it may help him to achieve victory over the enemy."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Thank you, _____, your service to our people has been most helpful. The time has come for our people to make war with the Ry`gorr. They must pay for their transgressions against our people. We are just waiting on you. Prepare yourself for glorious battle and tell me when you are [ready]."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Give this to Gloradin and return to me immediately, it is time. May Brell be with us!"},{"npc":"Gloradin Coldheart","text":"Thank you. I will return to the Dain and inform him that the battle is underway. Please escort Garadain to the battlefield and see that he returns safely. May Brell bless you and bring you victory over these beasts."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Follow me closely, friend, time is of the essence. I will describe our situation as we walk."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"The Dain's own royal troops will be at our disposal for the battle. This is good news, they are hardened, experienced soldiers. The bad news is that our sources indicate that the Ry`gorr have been alerted to our presence and will be ready for an attack. This is most unfortunate... They will not go down without a fierce fight."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"It is of utmost importance that you stay with me throughout the fight. Your focus must be on killing Chief Rygorr and keeping me alive, mind that you do not become distracted. If I fall the Dain's men will retreat and you'll definitely be cut down."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"TROOPS! FALL IN!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Listen up men!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"You all know why we're here. For decades these savages have menaced our people. Recent events have been too much to bear and the Dain has declared war! We will stop at nothing short of the Ry`gorr's annihilation!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"No longer will we tolerate their heathen presence in our lands! Never again will we mourn the loss of a Coldain to these pawns of the Kromrif! Our deeds here today shall make this land safe for Coldain for all time!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Today the Ry`gorr fall! Tomorrow the Kromrif!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Fall out men!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Stay back from the initial charge, my friend. We will go directly for the chief once the troops are engaged. Follow me closely!"},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"Good work friend! The Dain will hear of this right away. We couldn't have defeated the Ry'gorr without your help. Take this ring as proof that you have served the Coldain well. You may wish to show it to the Seneschal should you ever stop in our fine city. Farewell, ______, it has been my pleasure knowing you."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Well done _____, I have heard of your victory over the Ry'Gorr. If you are willing to assist the crown further please follow me."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Please, shut the door behind you. What I am about to share with you must not be overheard."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"My army stands prepared to launch an assault on Kael itself, but one task must be completed before this can happen."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"It seems Rodrick was not alone in his treachery. There is a faction of Coldain who believe that a treaty should be signed with the Kromrif, ending our hostilities with them. This, of course, is impossible. If there is one thing our history here has taught us it is that the Kromrif simply cannot be trusted."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"These traitors are poisoning the minds of our citizens, promising great rewards to those who will betray the Dain. It will take an unbiased eye of an outlander to flush out masterminds behind this plan. Once again we turn to you."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Will you accept this task, outlander?"},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"In this box, place the Accursed Dirk of the Fallen Rodrick. With it combine the heads of every traitor you dispose of. When this is done give the box and the Velium insignia ring to the Dain directly. On behalf of the crown and all good Coldain, I thank you.....May Brell be with you."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Farewell"},{"npc":"Doldigun Steinwielder","text":"Uhh, I think I'll be leaving now... Give my regards to Thurgadin."},{"npc":"Dain Frostreaver IV","text":"My good ______, you have served me well. You have flushed out all who sought to oppose me and my people. I am afraid I need to call upon you and your friends one final time. The dissension and treason ran deeper than I had anticipated. Our population has been cleansed, but we lost a full third of our army to the poisonous words of those rebels. In retaliation for your deeds, the Kromrif have made plans to attack us in this, our weakest hour. Can I count on your help outlander?"},{"npc":"Dain Frostreaver IV","text":"Several of our greatest officers, including a few veterans from the war on Yesterwinter are assembling just outside our city. Gather your army at once and give this parchment and the ninth ring to Sentry Badian. I will remain inside the city with a few of my troops to defend it against any who might penetrate your defense. May Brell be with you, ______."},{"npc":"Sentry Badain","text":"I'll be right with you, _____."},{"npc":"Garadain Glacierbane","text":"With all due respect, Seneschal, I feel my men are best suited for the eastern post. If the outlander has rounded up enough soldiers to hold 'em off from the south then they'll definitely test us in the gorge. We'll be needin' a solid defense there."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Very well, Garadain, the eastern post is yours. I'll place Kargin and his bowmen on the hill to the west, and Churn, you'll station your troops up near the caves just past them."},{"npc":"Churn the Axeman","text":"Understood sir."},{"npc":"Sentry Badain","text":"Excuse me, Seneschal Aldikar, you instructed me to report to you when the outlander returned. I have brought him."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Perfect timing outlander, please be seated and listen carefully. Badain, yer dismissed."},{"npc":"Sentry Badain","text":"Sir, yessir!"},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"We knew the day might come when the Kromrif would discover the location of our beloved city. It was only prudent for there to be a plan for such a circumstance. In light of recent developments, however, our plans have been adjusted. Outlander, the Dain has appointed you to lead our armies in defense of Thurgadin."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"I will stand here with a handful of men as a final line of defense. Should I fall, all will be lost. You will have these men and their soldiers to command. Use them wisely, you will be richly rewarded if your forces are able to keep them alive."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Garadain will post his men in the gorge to the east. Churn and his men will await your command in the caves to the west. Dobbin will have his forces at the ready in the clearing directly south of here near the towers. If any Kromrif make it to his vicinity he and his men will attack with or without your command."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Lastly, Corbin will hide his men in the worm caves to the south, call on him for a surprise attack. Remember where these men are stationed, outlander. Should they call out for help you may wish to send some of your people to aid them."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"The leader of this invasion is a powerful Kromrif named Narandi. Rumor has it that he is more powerful than any ten of his peers. He must fall. When he is slain you must show his head and the ninth ring to me."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Scout Zrelik here will follow you and serve as your herald. He will relay your orders to the troops. Show me your ninth ring now to verify your identity and I will give you the orders to memorize."},{"npc":"Seneschal Aldikar","text":"Commit these orders to memory, ______, have them ready to speak at a moment's notice. When you are finished memorizing, repeat them to me. Tell your soldiers to prepare themselves. When the orders are handed to Zrelik we will take up our positions."},{"npc":"Zrelik the Scout","text":"At yer service, ______. Remember now, before issuing me an order ya must disengage from any combat and be sure yer speakin to me. I advise you to avoid combat at all costs, your leadership is crucial."},{"npc":"Narandi the Wretched's corpse","text":"Rallos! Please accept my soul... I pray that you may find me worthy."},{"npc":"Dain Frostreaver IV","text":"______, your deeds have changed the fate of my people forever. Not since the sacrifice of Colin Dain himself has anyone so selflessly risked so much for our well being. Accept this blessing as a token of my gratitude."},{"npc":"Dain Frostreaver IV","text":"The people of Thurgadin are in your debt, ______. Please accept the Coldain Hero's Ring as a token of our gratitude. The curse has been removed from the blade as well. I hope you find it useful against our common foes. When you are interested in assisting me further please show me the blade. Until that day, may Brell bless and protect you."},{"npc":"Dain Frostreaver IV","text":"Several of our greatest officers, including a few veterans from the war on Yesterwinter are assembling just outside our city. Gather your army at once and give this parchment and the ninth ring to Sentry Badian. I will remain inside the city with a few of my troops to defend it against any who might penetrate your defense. May Brell be with you, ______."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:13:34.163Z","outOfEra":true}
